###########################################
# Build- and CI-time credentials only.
#
# Copy to .env.build. Deliberately separate from .env: .env is passed to every
# application container via `env_file:`, so anything in it is readable by the
# app. Nothing here is needed at runtime.
###########################################

# Credentials used by `make git-build-montrek-container` to push the image.
# The image coordinates are not here: CONTAINER_REGISTRY, CONTAINER_NAMESPACE,
# CONTAINER_IMAGE and CONTAINER_TAG belong in .env, because docker-compose.yml
# interpolates all four to decide which image to run, and compose reads .env
# only. Setting them here would push to one image and run another.
# For Forgejo: GIT_USER is your Forgejo login, GIT_PAT an access token
# with the `write:package` (and `read:package`) scope.
GIT_USER=<<Your registry username>>
GIT_PAT=<<Your registry access token>>

###########################################
# SonarQube (make local-sonarqube-scan)
###########################################

# SONARCUBE_URL=
# SONARCUBE_TOKEN=
